  - Elixhauser
  - Combined Comorbidity Score
  - Hospital Frailty Risk Score
  - frailty
  - ICD-10
  - ICD-10-GM
  - ICD-10-CM
  - ICD-9
  - administrative data
  - risk adjustment
  - epidemiology
  - health informatics
  - polars
  - python
